{"articleNo":"147117","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=147117&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학생 예비군 대원 신고 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.03","hit":"2551","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">현재 재학중인 학생으로 '지역예비군'으로&nbsp;편성되어 있는</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>재학생은</strong> </font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>예비군연대(디지털관 122호)<font color=\"#000000\">에서 예비군 대원신고를</font></strong></font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">하시어 대학예비군으로 변경하시기 바랍니다</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 회사 직장예비군 편성자는 제외</span></strong></span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2016.3.</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교예비군연대장</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">비고 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">예비군 년간 훈련시간</sp